{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woken up suddenly,  you play as Michael Salvatore, a father tormented by the sudden disappearance of his daughter, Haze..As you investigate Haze\u2019s room, you\u2019ll uncover tools like the axe embedded in her bedroom wall\u00a0 that may seem like\u00a0 the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LATE 2 ESCAPE: CHAPTER 1 includes a a twisted compelling story that gets better through each chapter.While playing Chapter 1 you will collect items that belongs to your daughter Haze.  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/241ecfb8796d5d949f507d78bbbf9c2c.avif?t=1770004228\" width=500 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/38e53dae2777a55654b40f44fe56d9cb.poster.avif?t=1770004228\" width=500 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/38e53dae2777a55654b40f44fe56d9cb.webm?t=1770004228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/38e53dae2777a55654b40f44fe56d9cb.mp4?t=1770004228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are your main sources of light and your only comfort. Use them to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ignite candles that reveal hidden symbols, paths, or ward off the oppressive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >darkness creeping in around you.&quot;Matches don\u2019t grow on body bags, use them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >like your life depends on it&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c